1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,750
Same pressure on a bigger area means a bigger force.

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:09,492
f over a equals F over A, so F is f times A over a.

3
00:00:09,492 --> 00:00:11,614
A small push lifts a whole car.

4
00:00:11,614 --> 00:00:17,708
That is the hydraulic lift, the hydraulic press, and the brakes in every vehicle on the road.

